A licensee who intends to broadcast its service on(a) a radio frequency;

(b) any spare capacity or sub-carrier on a television or radio channel; or

(c) television lines in the Vertical Blanking Interval, shall, before the comme~1cement of the broadcast of its service, inform the Minister of its intention to broadcast its service by such means and obtain such approvals as the Minister may direct for the broadcast of its service by such means.
